@startuml adversarial_framework
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  BorderColor #333333
  BorderThickness 2
}

component [**Red Agent**\n(Fixed Policy)\n\nMITRE ATT&CK\nConsistent Attacks] as RedAgent #FFE6E6
component [**Blue Agent**\n(PPO Learning)\n\nAdaptive Policy\nStrategic Decoys] as BlueAgent #E6F3FF
component [**Cyberwheel Environment**\n\nNetwork State Updates\nReward Generation] as Environment #E6FFE6

RedAgent --> Environment : Attack Actions
BlueAgent --> Environment : Defense Actions
Environment --> RedAgent : Observations
Environment --> BlueAgent : States & Rewards

note right of BlueAgent : Learning through\nPPO Optimization
note left of RedAgent : Fixed adversarial\nbehavior for consistency

@enduml
